      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Tough draw for BETTOR ONE (11) but he is a progressive colt in good form. Made it two wins on the trot when he came from this row and worked hard but dig deep to score at this circuit and distance last time. He may have to do it the hard way again but he should be at his peak now. BROADWAYBEAUTY (4) is really delivering now. Won her maiden at Albion Park two back then led from this barrier to get home by 2m at this circuit and distance last week. Can push forward again and is in form at the right time. SAN LUCA (9) was just edged out by Better One last week. Starts on the back row this time but with even luck can get into the finish. FLIRTACIOUS MISS (2) has performed well as runner-up in the last two outings and draws to be competitive.",
